Package: fidusconvert
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Command-line tool for Fidus Writer document conversion
 fidusconvert provides command-line tools for converting between
 Fidus Writer (.fidus) document format and various other formats including
 DOCX, ODT, LaTeX, HTML, EPUB, JATS, and Pandoc JSON.
 .
 It is built on top of the @fiduswriter/document library which implements
 the Fidus Writer document schema, importers, and exporters.
